                                   "snippet":  "The Temple of the Golden Pavilion (金閣寺, Kinkaku-ji) is a novel by the Japanese author Yukio Mishima. It was published in 1956 and translated into English by Ivan Morris in 1959.",
                                   "link":  "en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Temple_of_the_Golden_Pavilion"
